      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-25T10:04:04Z",
      "note": "The first rfBTC transaction in the Reaper attacker campaign is 0x7f79934a...3754 at block 44045646 index 0. Its trace contains four direct calls to redeem(uint256,address,address), each naming receiver 0x2c177d20...a954 and a different owner; all four owners have zero allowance to caller 0x8162a5e1...0145 at block 44045645. Three campaign receipts contain 11 matching Withdraw events and exactly 9.69794911 BTC. Earlier third-party withdrawals use unrelated caller/receiver pairs and are outside this campaign; later withdrawals to safe 0x539ef36c...88e0 are rescue activity. Creation transaction 0xe7dbf3c8...171f made the direct vault at block 42082997 index 1. Code is empty one block earlier, and the 16,821-byte runtime hash 0x430f90b9...d8b9eb is identical at creation, a midpoint, and the pre-exploit block. EIP-1967 implementation, beacon and admin slots are zero, and the exploit trace has no DELEGATECALL from the vault. The code age is 2,382,213 seconds. USD uses the nearest DefiLlama BTC price, $22,873.131742888752 at timestamp 1659416753."
    }
